  "description": "Choi Sung-Hyun looks like the perfect catch, handsome, brilliant, and effortlessly privileged. In truth, he’s barely getting by, clinging to a carefully crafted illusion funded by the wealthy men he dates. That fragile life begins to unravel when Kang Joon reenters the picture. Unable to accept being forgotten, Joon’s fixation turns dark. His presence closes in, his control deepens, and before long, Sung-Hyun finds himself trapped in an obsession he can’t escape.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
